# Design tokens

Source of truth: `FLUTTER_SPEC.md` + `lib/core/theme/`. Hex, radius, and type sizes live only there.

## Colors

```dart
context.colors.bg
context.colors.surface1 // cards
context.colors.surface2 // inputs
context.colors.surface3
context.colors.line / line2
context.colors.text / text2 / text3
context.colors.button / onButton
context.colors.green / greenBg / amber / amberBg / red
```

Magr aliases still work (`primary` → `button`, `black` → `text`, `white` → `surface1`). Prefer the spec names in new code.

```dart
// BAD
Color(0xFF101214)
Colors.grey
BorderRadius.circular(12)

// GOOD
context.colors.text
AppRadius.buttonAll
```

## Radius (never above 14)

`AppRadius.image` 6 · `chip` 6 · `button` 8 · `card` 10 · `sheet` 14

## Spacing + Gaps

`AppSpacing.xs` 4 · `sm` 6 · `md` 9 · `lg` 13 · `xl` 18 (screen pad) · `xxl` 24

```dart
// BAD
SizedBox(height: 18)
EdgeInsets.all(16)
EdgeInsets.only(left: 18)

// GOOD
Gaps.vGap18
padding: const EdgeInsetsDirectional.symmetric(horizontal: AppSpacing.xl)
```

Use `Gaps.hGap*` / `Gaps.vGap*` between widgets. Use `AppSpacing` inside `EdgeInsetsDirectional`. Never `left` / `right`.

## Text

New UI uses named tokens + a color from `context.colors`:

`AppTextStyle.screenTitle` · `sectionTitle` · `itemTitle` · `price` · `priceUnit` · `body` · `caption` · `micro`

Magr `AppTextStyle.s14_w500(color: ...)` is allowed for existing screens. Never raw `TextStyle(fontSize: ...)`.

Font is IBM Plex Sans Arabic via `AppTheme.fontFamily`. Do not set a different `fontFamily` in widgets.

## Material look

No ripple (`NoSplash`), no elevation/shadows, no `ListTile`, no `surfaceTint`. Hairline borders (`context.colors.line`) instead of shadows.
